    "message": "This release restarts the package versioning at 0.1.0. Previous NuGet versions have been unlisted/removed. The codebase remains functionally compatible with the current API surface; consumers adopting SGuard from this version should not require code changes.\n\n ## Notes\n            - If you were using earlier package versions, please migrate to `0.1.0`. No runtime breaking changes are expected.",
    "reasons": [
      "Other"
    ]
  },
  "description": "SGuard is a lightweight guard library for .NET that offers explicit boolean checks (Is.*) and throwing guards (ThrowIf.*), a unified GuardCallback/GuardOutcome model, and richly-informative exceptions via CallerArgumentExpression for easier diagnostics. Targets net6.0/net7.0/net8.0/net9.0.",
